# Arroz Con Vegetales

Based on [https://foodanddealsbylaura.com/arroz-con-vegetales/](https://foodanddealsbylaura.com/arroz-con-vegetales/)

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 2 cups [rice]{ ing="rice" }
- [ ] 2.5 cups [mixed vegetables]{ ing="mixed-vegetables" } (carrots, green beans, peas, corn kernel)
- [ ] 4 cups [chicken broth]{ ing="chicken-broth" } (or water)
- [ ] 1 tsp [powder chicken bullion]{ ing="powder-chicken-bullion" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [vegetable oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" }
- [ ] 1 clove [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 1/4 cup [onion]{ ing="onion" }, chopped
- [ ] 1/4 tsp [cumin]{ ing="cumin" } (optional)
- [ ] 1 [piece jalapeño]{ ing="piece-jalape-o" }

## Recipe

1. Place [rice]{ ing="rice" } in a container, cover with water, and let sit briefly to remove excess starch. This improves texture.
1. Drain [rice]{ ing="rice" } in a strainer and rinse thoroughly under running water. Shake off excess water.
1. Sauté [onion]{ ing="onion" } and [garlic]{ ing="garlic" } in [vegetable oil]{ ing="vegetable-oil" } over medium heat. Once onion changes color, add [rice]{ ing="rice" } and stir.
1. Once [rice]{ ing="rice" } changes color, add 4 cups [broth]{ ing="chicken-broth" } (or water), [cumin]{ ing="cumin" }, [salt]{ ing="salt" }, and [chicken bullion]{ ing="powder-chicken-bullion" }.
1. Cut [jalapeño]{ ing="piece-jalape-o" } lengthwise and place on top of [rice]{ ing="rice" }.
1. Bring to high heat and allow water to boil.
1. Cover, reduce heat to low, and cook [rice]{ ing="rice" } 15-18 minutes.
1. Add [vegetables]{ ing="mixed-vegetables" } on top, cover again, and cook at low heat for 5 minutes.
1. For pre-cooked [vegetables]{ ing="mixed-vegetables" }: Turn off heat and cover to finish cooking with residual warmth.
1. For fresh [vegetables]{ ing="mixed-vegetables" }: Add when water boils; cook with [rice]{ ing="rice" }.
1. For frozen [vegetables]{ ing="mixed-vegetables" }: Thaw first by soaking in water (change water twice), drain, then add after [rice]{ ing="rice" } is cooked. Cover 5 minutes.
1. Verify [vegetables]{ ing="mixed-vegetables" } are tender and [rice]{ ing="rice" } is fully cooked.

## Notes

- Pairs excellently with chicken, fish, or beef entrées
- Represents authentic Mexican home-style preparation
